        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1070] The SECC shall always accept the EVPowerProfile of the EVCC (see 8.3.5.3.9) if it does not violate the rules of requirement [V2G20-1559].",
            "block_bbox": [
                71,
                972,
